---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>About Phil Lyons</title>
</head>
<body>
  <Header />
  <main class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Experience, curiosity and a genuine interest in people.</h1>
    <p>I work with organisations to create photography and film that communicates clearly. Whether it is engineering, manufacturing, people or products, the aim is always the same: make something complex understandable and something ordinary memorable.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

<style>
.page { padding-top: 10rem; max-width: 900px; }
.eyebrow { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15em; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
</style>
